TEXT -32 376 Left 2 ;L-match network: Rs=10 ohm source matched to RL=50 ohm\nload at f=435MHz (UHF CubeSat beacon downlink band).\nValues independently verified via ngspice AC analysis:\nZin(435MHz) = 9.994 + j0.003 ohm (target 10+j0), peak return\nloss 53.87dB at 434.4MHz, -10dB bandwidth 345-509MHz.\nSee STAGE3_FINDINGS.md for full derivation and verification.\nProbe V(vout) and compute impedance looking into the network\nfrom the Rs side to reproduce the ngspice verification here.
